        "created_at": "2014-02-12T08:51:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just had the thought that if you really wanted to stress test your calculator's overflow buffer, you should also take into account the number of&nbsp;possible orders the cards in&nbsp;each deck could&nbsp;be in.</p>",
